simTycoonAwayMatchdays: green.
   Away matchdays are the live match on the same rolls, one per half hour, hidden or closed alike.
   They pay no goal or win bonus, keep what they reach, and the final matchday of every season waits for you.
   All 6 controls fired exactly where they should, in node and in the real hook.
